## 8. 阶段 (Phases)

按 plan §"状态机" 流转：

- **Phase 0 — INIT**: 状态机初始化
- **Phase 1 — CONTEXT**: context-scout 跑仓库侦察
- **Phase 2 — REQUIREMENT**: requirement-clarifier + requirement-analyst (读本 SPEC)
- **Phase 3 — PLAN**: solution-architect + planner 产出实现方案
- **Phase 4 — CODE**: feature-coder + tdd-guide 写代码
- **Phase 5 — VERIFY**: regression-guard 跑 verify.sh
- **Phase 6 — REVIEW**: code-reviewer + security-gate (本仓库修复后)
- **Phase 7 — FIX**: fixer 三分类归因后修复
- **Phase 8 — DELIVER**: delivery-reporter 写交付报告
- **Phase 9 — SAFE_STOP**: 配额尽时诚实部分交付

## 9. 验证 (Verification)

- baseline: `cd ... && node tests/run-all.js` → 期望 passed=N failed=M
